urces></patcit> <patcit ucid="JP-7273762-A" status="new"><document-id status="new" format="epo"><country>JP</country> <doc-number>7273762</doc-number> <kind>A</kind></document-id><sources><source category="Y" name="SEA" created-by-npl="N"/></sources></patcit></patent-citations><non-patent-citations><nplcit status="new"><text>See also references of EP     1054535A1</text><sources><source name="SEA" created-by-npl="N"/></sources></nplcit></non-patent-citations></citations></technical-data><parties><applicants><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>CHIKADA MICHIYASU</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>NTT DOCOMO INC</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>TANIGUCHI TETSUYA</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>CHIKADA, MICHIYASU</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>NTT DOCOMO, INC.</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TANIGUCHI, TETSUYA</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>CHIKADA MICHIYASU</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>TANIGUCHI TETSUYA</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>CHIKADA, MICHIYASU</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TANIGUCHI, TETSUYA</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>When a disconnection occurs in a telecommunication line, a communication control module tries a reconnection without notifying a communication module of the trouble if the connection is considered resumable. The telecommunication line may be reconnected, for instance, if the disconnection is temporary or if the network conditions are good. When the telecommunication line has been reconnected, the communication module does not notice the disconnection of the telecommunication line. After that, therefore, the communication module resumes the data communication in the same manner as before.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>Lorsqu'une rupture se produit dans une ligne de télécommunication, un module de commande de transmission tente une reconnexion sans notifier un module de transmission du problème si la connexion est considérée comme pouvant être rétablie. La ligne de télécommunication peut être reconnectée, par exemple, si la rupture est temporaire ou si les conditions du réseau sont bonnes. Lorsque la ligne de télécommunication a été reconnectée, le module de transmission ne s'aperçoit pas de la rupture de la ligne de télécommunication. Ensuite, par conséquent, le module de transmission reprend la transmission de données de la même manière qu'avant.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>